An explicitly unbalanced transaction warns but retains its postings.

========== API ==========

aggregate({ accounts: ['^Assets:Cash$'] })

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity FUND
  format 1,000 FUND
account Assets:Cash
account Assets:Fund
account Equity:Opening
2024-01-01 Unbalanced
  Assets:Cash  1 SEK
  Equity:Opening  -0.6 SEK

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "account": "Assets:Cash",
    "commodity": "SEK",
    "quantity": "1"
  }
]

========== WARNINGS ==========

[MISSING_DEFAULT_COMMODITY] Journal must declare one default commodity
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:1:1

[UNBALANCED_TRANSACTION] Transaction does not balance: 0.4 SEK
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:8:1
